{
  "article_id": "3580480498-2247487528_1",
  "title": "云南一周游归来",
  "source_url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Naf0dQA9SC5zW-8WsHdLTA",
  "publish_time": 1609002109,
  "status": "body_recovered",
  "extraction_method": "article_dom",
  "body_text": "一周的游学（观光）归来\n图片集锦（部分可见人的照片）👇\n劳作体验篇\n三原色采摘组成团了 - 出发（\n小田\n，\n郭郭\n，\n小塔\n）\n有胆你上来呀😈\n😠哼，上来就上来\n😠说，怎么个比法！... 嗯，比谁的照片好看如何？😈\n我要先酝酿下情绪\n严严实实摘果子，拒绝蚊虫叮咬\n多好的果子啊\n结果分晓 平手 - 哎...就这么一点儿\n其实这个时候是不用进去人挑的，但小塔实在是太热情积极了-忍不住\n晒床劳作体验之挑瑕疵果\n挑出来的是介个样子\n浮选洗刷刷体验（我们的鲜果上晒床前必须要做的一道工序）\n体验晒场劳作（讲真，他们翻的可认真了，我都没这么干过）\n晾晒的是“统豆”\n体验水洗处理之... 好像不是介个样子的...哦，这个时候是要站在池子里面的\n娱乐篇\n郭郭跳 Guo‘s Jump\n塔跳 Alex’s YEAH Jump - 常用动作\n啊...大山啊...带我（们）飞吧 - 小田像是有外“挂”一样\nWUENWUENWUEN 开车咯，坐稳\n小塔不光是生活小百科，还会爬树\n就为了摘它，小塔从树上掉了下来，没抓拍到掉下来的高光时刻，可惜了 - 这颗还没长熟就被摘下来的木瓜\n小板凳一坐，在农户家又找回了小时候看电视的感觉\n吃喝篇\n包浆豆腐 - 第一次吃，超赞！！！\n臭豆腐鱼锅（本来叫啥不记得了，但这个臭豆腐锅只是闻到淡淡的臭豆腐气味，吃起来很香，汤很好喝）\n基本上每一顿都好饿好好吃，吃的差不多了才想起拍照\n每次都要吃的米线-景东三妞早点\n他们吃腻了米线，出来找点其他吃的\n其它杂记\n上蔓飞龙有一部分修水泥路，但还没有修完，有800米要步行搬运\n发酵桶的龙头需要从里面锁紧，没办法，我进不去，就只好...\n烤火+烧水做咖啡（山上只有太阳能发电用于简单照明，生活全靠柴火）\n专注的咖啡师&专注开黑的“王者”\n郭郭说这是我那天拍他的最好的一张照片，我😓，好在哪里\n这张照片怎么是这个场景我也不记得了\n半路对面的车子轮子飞了，坐摩托上山\n庄园旁一户小农家 - 老两口带着“留守”的孙女，咖啡是他们一年主要的生计来源，家里收拾的特别的干净\n彩蛋 - 猜猜下面3幅图里哪个是Catimor 哪个是Gesha\n猜对的话，奖励一包挂耳，可门店自提或者线上买豆时附赠",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          一周的游学（观光）归来\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          图片集锦（部分可见人的照片）👇\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           劳作体验篇\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr0XDxtIfriaicHB2KDmfJN91tDTbg0DwDPoMWQaeZel516yDS3vgic5K2CA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          三原色采摘组成团了 - 出发（\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(217, 33, 66);\">\n          小田\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          ，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 128, 255);\">\n          郭郭\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          ，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(214, 168, 65);\">\n          小塔\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          ）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr0TrS0fx9hcDGInsiaYuHKiaKp8eQdicfQxOT69OibQcKPQPLxtfZ6z9eL7Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          有胆你上来呀😈\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr0WMuOenollWUBeW0vUbkcjbuCxS67yEtqK1mljeC7yyQnC5CYsxd5mw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: right;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          😠哼，上来就上来\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr0sib1J7yLiaLB8AviaaZ5uGfx2YnibHNiaBbAue0vRAicpdzr6VYmhz73G3ibA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          😠说，怎么个比法！... 嗯，比谁的照片好看如何？😈\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr0xricKtBzkcfjYHqlfunORMLRAdhe9ZUsfs5eicwN69raKxJjzfxnu8Pg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: right;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          我要先酝酿下情绪\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr09qB2icsS8GsBvVyTtS7TV6YIFY7t5UgV6snzSlD8YP48Zxv0j8xRqYA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          严严实实摘果子，拒绝蚊虫叮咬\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr0DyRDphcQbQ0O4G1EWtqtQhggV1YmV3cYEpqvx6IhzLMOHJYPTWIQibg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          多好的果子啊\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr09KeFMntKicMYSqa1kFH0lpWbT9XNXib1gajHv5gkJBxVqxO5cpu7u4VQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          结果分晓 平手 - 哎...就这么一点儿\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr0ZFias6eTABLPibxbHEX5FQCag80qTBg8icxOuqewqTTKlx5IzHP8L7USQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"display: inline;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          其实这个时候是不用进去人挑的，但小塔实在是太热情积极了-忍不住\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr0SUzvu3S6WibXME5PdHlILLIkq3fiaCEuor5Y49ULDO1O6GsP7TugJ8Mg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: right;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          晒床劳作体验之挑瑕疵果\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr02libAm3ETbg2uDSzv28D4rwfpv9Sn9lIS6iaOwCKpAibBkiaISBzhBh3HA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;width: 578px;height: 545px;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          挑出来的是介个样子\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr0PJdKuHebfrED8TyYc9674yZ0S7rgBLHpzuJJsh9wC6RuEdKoDrRvUw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          浮选洗刷刷体验（我们的鲜果上晒床前必须要做的一道工序）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr0BewggZfr926XYCrSmibSNhfqZ9ZYzN2dpRmSGrnmlunVAkpXBib6xvgw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          体验晒场劳作（讲真，他们翻的可认真了，我都没这么干过）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          晾晒的是“统豆”\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr0A9B39ibXN0EaQJSAp2kysYWqk8CoiaJ7ibskxysoAAmHGbKVBm1VgdUpA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          体验水洗处理之... 好像不是介个样子的...哦，这个时候是要站在池子里面的\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           娱乐篇\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr0FPDsbW2AgYzKJO4AicGsxgMjibziaTQekYfkPgQLcl4XHmQL56kESu6oA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          郭郭跳 Guo‘s Jump\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr0fH02x17150a23OgOmBIbkPY1gmfBEJwmUmibsA12MZ8FICBWOvJ158w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          塔跳 Alex’s YEAH Jump - 常用动作\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr0RBSPGwKanFAQsXFskdJoiche8Pb2UibQDpSrZn9wAYLd8v4gxEcUAibgg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          啊...大山啊...带我（们）飞吧 - 小田像是有外“挂”一样\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr0XfpgmYr2vndcjTjAyCoP22lWSIXlqEicENeovpQB6nsdhyHic3LOsCTg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          WUENWUENWUEN 开车咯，坐稳\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr0c485nZo8RbNenMmFo3ic6vVRGPqDFPDPglEYbMMDKBwagJj5lNGyU5g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 578px;height: 631px;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          小塔不光是生活小百科，还会爬树\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr0IZVM5Yrdlo6WTibCXm5ds822ySIqibTxRiarKhnQntWbH3ZiaEvbn1HjzA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          就为了摘它，小塔从树上掉了下来，没抓拍到掉下来的高光时刻，可惜了 - 这颗还没长熟就被摘下来的木瓜\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr0lMC1HFjoNmuj3zaBe6QpibEyCvq98PAyKjMrNR9wbbVBIyEZDvT9icFg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          小板凳一坐，在农户家又找回了小时候看电视的感觉\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           吃喝篇\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr0r4SFV2zDWlASosq1A7CNLlg1XEMNRJNvC1rq9aVnuJ2FzzwicGlgCIw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          包浆豆腐 - 第一次吃，超赞！！！\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr0icKpFUYxI8VJCmCTaubqP3NpHzLzg9WjC8anfJjPVSoibyO92W1SEvxQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          臭豆腐鱼锅（本来叫啥不记得了，但这个臭豆腐锅只是闻到淡淡的臭豆腐气味，吃起来很香，汤很好喝）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr01bvNHz9FHMP1ibvYkyPnKvhFn62La4gMWplfDRMZgnvP17LG5x4TGQA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          基本上每一顿都好饿好好吃，吃的差不多了才想起拍照\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr0sdEbW85QeytvvPqqKre2icia3ACFB3eb3ezl5AKGTXMRgVNF8x93FPLQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          每次都要吃的米线-景东三妞早点\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr0jRLyfZ7xXic4EfWLEcVAQ5bzISd3NIGZuibxpa0JmgWIFlTlSbupQKDw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          他们吃腻了米线，出来找点其他吃的\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           其它杂记\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr00YHzIwPWUeFdJk64gPyAHIpIO6pJNldxeicrwQrAnVteq9JTwpuiahow/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          上蔓飞龙有一部分修水泥路，但还没有修完，有800米要步行搬运\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr0FYeDbcyvAG9nKbTpcX3FozQmmCQFktaAoWcW81tSJuavJ7JPIiaoUag/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"height: 538px;width: 578px;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          发酵桶的龙头需要从里面锁紧，没办法，我进不去，就只好...\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr0IshcpDic6PibQiaHQBqq9R7wKEWISCnibRBpB5PcpRxHTcq8hdVYbHJ5ng/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          烤火+烧水做咖啡（山上只有太阳能发电用于简单照明，生活全靠柴火）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr0wmUJPM0GZru6aM24CVcRE0aicjPVKDhu1XGbEqoRiawkRC4Jdx3ZSSoQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          专注的咖啡师&amp;专注开黑的“王者”\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr01qcyiavdicSRiapLPW3C1WxT8XsdEgtZbicPR9ER7rUfBScgxyO8icayDZw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          郭郭说这是我那天拍他的最好的一张照片，我😓，好在哪里\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这张照片怎么是这个场景我也不记得了\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr0icGuTK5gia5tVEqK3hmNqyz2RLYOicxBjzDH4bxch9GZiaeA56ImNh2dGw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          半路对面的车子轮子飞了，坐摩托上山\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr0hSsia8qylcibgnfCpPASH9XHb1lvarTEzqFwPjgmuY1OUP76FzqGMTkQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          庄园旁一户小农家 - 老两口带着“留守”的孙女，咖啡是他们一年主要的生计来源，家里收拾的特别的干净\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n           彩蛋 - 猜猜下面3幅图里哪个是Catimor 哪个是Gesha\n          </strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          猜对的话，奖励一包挂耳，可门店自提或者线上买豆时附赠\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr0sMwUVp49GsBicdnCMXGf97NrniahO4Y5gic1jUuxKhHBQrEL3V7d7ARUw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr07CMUnRgpA6WqnhelLMJkfv88JJgLBWeFqgAHRtibk1IU9bZVfAuUTKA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkMtic0hfjrtSnBDDhGRSr0rpHcaUpjV93b8hkHcutwlzOOrwjQoCia8g1AWty00sIQX2dGaUu03vg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n</div>",
